  "limits": "Stylized, not a physical atmosphere: colours come from the uniforms, not from scattering. Stars are point-like only at moderate field of view; at very wide angles grid cells can show. Only the first directional light is read. Sky radiance for reflections updates with Godot's sky process mode.",
